title: I liked this prompt at the top of a vision document.
pid: 03cbcb27-f7f9-4b80-8263-5a2d427f2f2d
body: |2-
  Please read and think about this.
  Report anything unclear, inelegant, inefficient, or awkward about it,
  in the following section, 'problems'.
  Subdivide your questions and other feedback org-style
  (remember, the tree does not have to be uniform depth!)
  and I will respond inline.
  Please don't perform any git write ops for now, but read all you want.
